# Assembled package contents. The binaries (and the bundled libpcsclite) are
# build outputs: the release job drops them into each platform package right
# before `npm publish`, and npm/scripts/assemble-linux-x64.sh does the same
# thing locally for testing. Nothing here is source, so none of it is committed.
lpad-*/bin/lpad
lpad-*/lib/*.so
lpad-*/lib/*.so.*

# `npm pack` output from a local test run.
*.tgz
